<div class="faq-content-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet">
<div class="faq-answer-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet">
<p>Everything we eat is broken down by the digestive enzymes we produce in our salvia, pancreas and stomach, allowing nutrients to be efficiently absorbed into the bloodstream. The 17 digestive enzymes found in DEBLOAT+ are particularly beneficial for people suffering from IBS and other digestive issues. They help to break down specific food groups (e.g. carbs, starches, fats, etc.), supported by a trio of organic ingredients known for their anti-inflammatory properties: cinnamon, turmeric and ginger.</p>
</div>
