<p class="faq-number-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet">02</p>
<p class="faq-question-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet">REDUCES GAS</p>
</div>
<div class="faq-control-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet"></div>
</button>
<div class="faq-content-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet">
<div class="faq-answer-template--20753079206217__ss_faq_6_68fcet">
<p>Alpha galactosidase is 1 of the 17 digestive enzymes found in DEBLOAT+. It breaks down the oligosaccharides (a type of carbohydrate) found in beans and cruciferous vegetables such as broccoli and cabbage, known for causing excess gas and bloating. Cinnamon, turmeric and ginger also boast carminative benefits, meaning they break up gas in the gastrointestinal tract and stimulate antral contractions (the contractions which help food pass from one part of the gut to another).</p>
</div>
